{"id":"vod_bf_77309","vodId":"77309","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"鬼神童子 (1995)","name_cn":"鬼神童子 (1995)","date":"1995-01-01","year":"1995","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20241030-1/ccb7584fb166920399cfbdcd95cd7b06.webp"},"summary":"很久很久以前，人世间鬼怪横行，魑魅魍魉泛滥成灾。当时出现了一个最强的役小角，他降服了拥有强大实力的鬼神为自己所用，以铲除为非作歹的鬼怪。在役小角临死之际，他将鬼神封印，人世间绝少听闻鬼神的消息。时间来到了现代，役小角的后代小明（横山智佐 饰）在命运的驱使下解开封印，可是 高傲的前鬼根本不服从小明的役使，于是这个女孩只得将其变成童子的模样。与此同时，凭依兽大量出现，而许多可怕的敌人交替登场。人世间再度为难，小明能否继承祖先的遗志，和前鬼共同击退各路邪祟呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-10-31 00:36:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":51,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/guishentongzi1995/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/guishentongzi1995/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/guishentongzi1995/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/guishentongzi1995/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/guishentongzi1995/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/guishentongzi1995/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/guishentongzi1995/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/guishentongzi1995/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/guishentongzi1995/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/guishentongzi1995/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/guishentongzi1995/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/guishentongzi1995/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/guishentongzi1995/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvv7f.com/video/guishentongzi1995/